WEBVTT

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.936
"You know, Dad, those people
aren't in our apartment.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.176
They can't hear you.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.256
If you really cared, you would go
and thank them in person."

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.456
And I thought, "Hmm.
That's an interesting idea."

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:42.776
(Laughter)

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:47.856
Now I'm a writer, and for my books
I like to go on adventures.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:49.296
Go on quests.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:53.376
So I decided I'm going to take
my son up on his challenge.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.096
It seemed simple enough.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.976
And to make it even simpler,

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.496
I decided to focus on just one item.